<title>UK: Forties crude to load 26.4 mln barrels in February.</title>
<headline>Forties crude to load 26.4 mln barrels in February.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>About 26.4 million barrels of North Sea Forties crude oil are scheduled to load in February compared to 28.8 million barrels in January, traders said.</p>
</text>
